      "title": "orrery",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## orrery · Krea 2 (text to image)\n\nThe template expands to one prompt for Krea 2: `text` → CLIP Text Encode, `width`/`height` (from `: w832 h1216`) → the latent. The model runs through the Orrery Prompt (`model` in, `model` out to the KSampler): the results under the prompt show the live preview while it samples, and `LORA:` lines go on the model.\n\nThe **Orrery Prompt** node is the whole of orrery: write in its **Prompt** tab (this workflow opens with a quickstart; **New** has the other modes), roll it in **Test** without queueing, and rate what comes out in **Gallery**: the ratings steer the next rolls. **Roll** in the node queues this graph (next N clips or images: how many runs); what the Save node writes is logged to the gallery with the picks that made it.\n\n- `seed` drives the rolls and the sampler.\n\n[orrery on GitHub](https://github.com/pyros-projects/ComfyUI-orrery) · [the prompt language](https://github.com/pyros-projects/ComfyUI-orrery/blob/main/docs/dsl.md) · [H3 screenplays](https://github.com/pyros-projects/ComfyUI-orrery/blob/main/docs/h3.md)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## orrery · Krea 2 (text to image)\n\nThe template expands to one prompt for Krea 2: `text` → CLIP Text Encode, `width`/`height` (from `: w832 h1216`) → the latent. The text encoder is also wired into the Orrery Prompt's `clip`: Krea 2's Qwen3-VL can write, so it fills `--…--` slots and makes missing `__libraries__` when the node runs.\n\nThe **Orrery Prompt** node is the whole of orrery: write in its **Prompt** tab (this workflow opens with a quickstart; **New** has the other modes), roll it in **Test** without queueing, and rate what comes out in **Gallery**: the ratings steer the next rolls. **Roll** in the node queues this graph (next N clips or images: how many runs); what the Save node writes is logged to the gallery with the picks that made it.\n\n- `seed` drives the rolls and the sampler.\n- `LORA:` lines come out on `lora_stack`, for a loader with a `lora_stack` input (LoraManager, Efficiency …), which is not part of this core-nodes workflow.\n\n[orrery on GitHub](https://github.com/pyros-projects/ComfyUI-orrery) · [the prompt language](https://github.com/pyros-projects/ComfyUI-orrery/blob/main/docs/dsl.md) · [H3 screenplays](https://github.com/pyros-projects/ComfyUI-orrery/blob/main/docs/h3.md)"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
